  "rationale": "The agent produced and verified a 93-row, tab-separated association file, but its executed analysis is not the reference cell-type-specific cis-QTL procedure. The reference calls omicwas::ctcisQTL with the full genotype, position, composition, methylation, and covariate matrices, then writes that procedure’s output. In contrast, the agent first selected 1-Mb cis pairs and then, separately for each cell type, fit an ordinary least-squares model with only that cell type’s proportion and extracted the genotype×proportion interaction. This substitutes a single-proportion interaction test for ctcisQTL’s cell-type-specific model, leading to systematically different effect estimates, test statistics, and p-values. The discrepancy is substantive rather than a harmless alternate output representation: for example, rs6678176–cg19251656–CD4T is −0.00320 (p=0.757) in the reference but −0.16628 (p=0.261) in the agent output; the agent also reports an extreme −14.41 estimate for rs4292979–cg05337192–CD4T. Thus execution is demonstrated, but it demonstrates a materially different and insufficiently specified method for the requested cell-type-specific cis-QTL effects.",
